# Contact form (src/lib/contact.ts). Set these in Vercel > Settings > Environment Variables, or in a local .env.
RESEND_API_KEY=
# Optional. Default is Resend's onboarding sender, which only delivers to the email your Resend account was created with.
# After verifying a domain in Resend, use e.g.  Modern Telepathy <contact@moderntelepathy.com>
CONTACT_FROM=
